OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTudor Brown, a UK tech founder, tells
OL,7,Fthe BBC there were "jitters" around
OL,8,F"infinite AI growth" before the
OL,9,Fmidterms. He adds there's "a lot of
OL,10,Fmoney still being made in these
OL,11,Fcompanies and we'll start to see it
OL,12,Fcoming back a bit"
OL,14,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,15,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,16,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,17,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; the
OL,18,FUK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by 1.6%
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
