OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the larger losses in Asia came
OL,7,Ffrom memory chip makers - Japan, South
OL,8,FKorea and Taiwan make most of the chips
OL,9,Fand equipment for US data centres
